<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Terrible Traverse Loop (via Bennett Ridge/Fat Lady Trail/East Fork Trail/Pocket Creek Tie Trail)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:191-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.310224" lon="-121.641836"><ele>1426.3</ele><name>Bennett Pass Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:bennett-pass-sno-park, as in 189-2; confidence: high; pdf_page: 188; book_elev_ft: 4674; quote: The trail starts at Bennett Pass Sno-Park and goes 2.4 miles to the Terrible Traverse along a splendid, rolling, forested ridge following a primitive road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.298990" lon="-121.608880"><ele>1463.9</ele><name>Windy Saddle (west foot of the Terrible Traverse)</name><desc>source: as in 189-2: OSM node 5164478227 on Forest Road 3550; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 189; book_elev_ft: 4800; quote: the trail descends to Windy Saddle at the west foot of the Terrible Traverse</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.286397" lon="-121.600177"><ele>1591.7</ele><name>Bonney Junction road beside the Fat Lady view</name><desc>source: OSM node 33427661 on Forest Road 3550, 29 m west of the upper end of Forest Road 3540-641; confidence: high; pdf_page: 208; quote: skis across the Terrible Traverse then uphill 0.9 mile from Gunsight Notch Saddle to an obvious open area near the road. Leave the road, and ski 30 yards east through trees to the upper end of the Fat Lady Trail for the view.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.286615" lon="-121.599963"><ele>1600.5</ele><name>Top of the Fat Lady Trail (view)</name><desc>source: OSM node 3713226281, upper end of Forest Road 3540-641; confidence: high; pdf_page: 207; quote: a 0.9-mile road from a clearcut in upper Pocket Creek to the ridgecrest beside the Bonney Junction road, where there are grand views of the East Fork valley, Hood, and Adams</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.295170" lon="-121.593280"><ele>1428.4</ele><name>Mount Adams view clearcut</name><desc>source: as in 205-3: OSM node 3713226242, Forest Road 3540-640 / 3540-641; confidence: high; pdf_page: 208; book_elev_ft: 4640; quote: from the Upper Junction ski upward 1.3 miles on the upper Pocket Creek road to the Mount Adams view clearcut at 4,640 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.302220" lon="-121.603446"><ele>1288.4</ele><name>Upper Junction of Pocket Creek</name><desc>source: as in 205-3: OSM junction of Forest Road 3540 and 3540-640; confidence: high; pdf_page: 205; book_elev_ft: 4200; quote: It finally reaches a huge clearcut that climbs moderately to the Upper Junction of Pocket Creek, directly under Bennett Ridge.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.309802" lon="-121.628009"><ele>1315.5</ele><name>East Fork Trail west end (Tie Trail / Teacup Lake Trail clearcut)</name><desc>source: as in 191-4: OSM node 33434179 on Forest Road 3540; confidence: high; pdf_page: 207; quote: At its west end the trail ends at a clearcut where two other trails join—Pocket Creek Tie Trail, descending 0.8 mile through forest from Bennett Pass</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.310224" lon="-121.641836"><ele>1426.3</ele><name>Bennett Pass Sno-Park (finish)</name><desc>source: as start; confidence: high; pdf_page: 207; book_elev_ft: 4674; quote: the Pocket Creek Tie Trail that climbs steeply through a clearcut, then forest, for 0.8 mile to Bennett Pass</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Terrible Traverse Loop (via Bennett Ridge/Fat Lady Trail/East Fork Trail/Pocket Creek Tie Trail)</name><desc>1. Bennett Pass Sno-Park -&gt; Windy Saddle (west foot of the Terrible Traverse): osm (high), 2.24 mi | 2. Windy Saddle (west foot of the Terrible Traverse) -&gt; Bonney Junction road beside the Fat Lady view: osm (high), 1.17 mi | 3. Bonney Junction road beside the Fat Lady view -&gt; Top of the Fat Lady Trail (view): straight (high), 0.02 mi | 4. Top of the Fat Lady Trail (view) -&gt; Mount Adams view clearcut: osm (high), 0.85 mi | 5. Mount Adams view clearcut -&gt; Upper Junction of Pocket Creek: osm (high), 1.32 mi | 6. Upper Junction of Pocket Creek -&gt; East Fork Trail west end (Tie Trail / Teacup Lake Trail clearcut): osm (high), 1.61 mi | 7. East Fork Trail west end (Tie Trail / Teacup Lake Trail clearcut) -&gt; Bennett Pass Sno-Park (finish): osm (high), 0.93 mi</desc>
